flowchart TB
  f["CPU: immutable frontier snapshot F<br/>batch vertex IDs u"]:::cpu
  m["MAPLE: fetch row bounds for batch b<br/>offsets[u], offsets[u+1]<br/>two bounded FIFO streams per worker"]:::maple
  h["CPU: consume matched bounds for the same batch b<br/>host metadata buffer + retained vertex IDs"]:::cpu
  x["CPU: stage bounds into DX source tiles<br/>publish count and visibility<br/>new adapter contract required"]:::cpu
  d["DX100: neighbor stage for batch b<br/>expand CSR ranges with continuation<br/>gather neighbor IDs in chunks"]:::dx
  c["CPU: associate u with each v<br/>parent load, CAS, retained store<br/>successful discovery queue push"]:::cpu
  out["CPU: flush next frontier<br/>join workers and finish the level"]:::cpu
  f -->|"CPU forms pointers"| m
  m -->|"consume delivers data; issue ACK is earlier"| h
  h --> x
  h -->|"CPU retains vertices[row_slot] association"| c
  x --> d
  d -->|"row ordinal + neighbor value; wait before reading"| c
  c --> out
  overlap["Intended overlap:<br/>MAPLE(n+1) runs while DX100 + CPU process n.<br/>Transfer, capacity and contention can limit benefit."]:::note
  noParent["Both accelerators read stable graph data.<br/>parent and next-frontier effects stay on CPU.<br/>Every SKETCH API is an unimplemented proposal."]:::note
